Market Challenges
Limited long-term field performance data for tandem modules makes it difficult to establish reliable lifetime projections. Accelerated laboratory tests may not fully reproduce decades of real-world operating conditions. Variations in module design, encapsulation and material composition also require customised testing procedures and additional technical expertise.

Market Restraints
The relatively small number of commercial-scale tandem module pilot batches limits the volume of testing assignments. Long testing cycles can constrain laboratory capacity and delay project completion. Differences in testing protocols and the need for specialised measurement equipment may further increase service costs.

